    <string name="guide_step1">Enter any world, then tap the menu button at the bottom right of the screen to open the quick menu.</string>
    <string name="guide_step2">In the quick menu, tap the gear at the bottom right to open Settings.</string>
    <string name="guide_step3">Tap the open-in-window icon at the top right to expand the full settings page.</string>
    <string name="guide_step4">Pick Avatars in the left list, then scroll down to the OSC section.</string>
    <string name="guide_step5">Turn on both OSC and OSC Debug Panel, then come back to VRCDI.</string>
    <string name="guide_pc_note">These screenshots are from the VRChat standalone / mobile build. On PC the switches are in the same place (Settings → Avatars → OSC), and you also need the launch option shown on the main screen.</string>
    <string name="guide_start">Got it, let\'s start</string>

